sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor agent as Agent
  participant srv as MCP server
  participant mtx as MediaMTX API
  agent->>srv: list_cameras()
  srv->>mtx: GET http://127.0.0.1:9997/v3/paths/list (5 s timeout)
  mtx-->>srv: paths with ready state and tracks
  Note over srv: If MediaMTX is down the call raises, it does not report not-ready
  srv-->>agent: four cameras with ready state
